VIDescription Line0001 = "Uses triggering to extract a segment out of a signal. The trigger conditions can be based on a start or stop trigger thr"
VIDescription Line0002 = "eshold or can be static. When a trigger condition is static, the trigger occurs immediately and this Express VI returns "
VIDescription Line0003 = "a predefined number of samples.\n--------------------\n\nThis Express VI is configured as follows:\n\nStart Trigger Conf"
VIDescription Line0004 = "iguration\nType: Threshold\r\nSense: Rising\r\nLevel: 0\r\nPre Samples: 0\n\r\nStop Trigger Configuration\nType: Immedia"
VIDescription Line0005 = "te\r\nSense: Rising\r\nLevel: 0\r\nSamples: 1000\n\r\nGeneral Configuration\r\nTrigger Channel: 0\nReset after each trig"
VIDescription Line0006 = "ger found: OFF\nRemain triggered after trigger found: OFF\nAutomatic # Samples: ON\nNumber of Output Samples: 10\nHyster"
VIDescription Line0007 = "esis: 0"
